## Never commit real secrets — appsettings.json/appsettings.Development.json
## only ever hold local/placeholder values; production connection strings,
## the Resend API key, and Google OAuth credentials must be supplied via
## environment variables or a secrets manager on the actual host, not a file
## in this repo. This also covers a future appsettings.Production.json.
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.*.local.json
*.secrets.json

